// Query name: CYBERMEDIC Daily IOC Hunt
// Description: Search 30-day Microsoft Defender telemetry for validated IOC values.
// Author : CYBERMEDIC
// Last updated: 2026-10-23
// MITRE ATT&CK mapping: N/A - IOC lookup
// Notes: One runnable query; exact IOC filters precede the 500-result limit.
// Sources: See the daily IOC summary for 2026-10-23.
DeviceNetworkEvents
| where Timestamp >= ago(30d)
| where RemoteIP in~ ("165.232.52.148","178.104.191.50","37.72.172.58","41.43.184.224","62.210.87.233","93.233.96.34")
| project Timestamp,DeviceName,RemoteIP,RemotePort,RemoteUrl,InitiatingProcessFileName
| top 500 by Timestamp desc
